  "solution": "[IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/952c967501c582f1911db7fefdaaefa9b6e3f505512624eb925e04e002be5a1f.png] \n\nGiven: (480 div 0.3 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 \n\nAccording to the question, after interchanging the numbers:\n\nOption 1): 500 and 190\n\n(480 div 0.3 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 ⇒ (480 div 0.3 times 5 + 190)/(500 + 9 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 \n\n⇒ (1600 times 5 + 190)/(500 + 9 times 16.875) = 2 \n\n⇒ (8000 + 190)/(500 + 151.875) = 2 \n\n⇒ (8190)/(651.875) = 2 \n\n⇒ 12.56 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 2): 0.3 and 1.6\n\n(480 div 0.3 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 ⇒ (480 div 1.6 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 27 div 0.3) = 2 \n\n⇒ (300 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 90) = 2 \n\n⇒ (1500 + 500)/(190 + 810) = 2 \n\n⇒ (2000)/(1000) = 2 \n\n**⇒ 2 = 2 (LHS = RHS)**\n\nOption 3): 27 and 480\n\n(480 div 0.3 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 ⇒ (27 div 0.3 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 480 div 1.6) = 2 \n\n⇒ (90 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 300) = 2 \n\n⇒ (450 + 500)/(190 + 2700) = 2 \n\n⇒ (950)/(2890) = 2 \n\n⇒ 0.32 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nOption 4): 5 and 9\n\n(480 div 0.3 times 5 + 500)/(190 + 9 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 ⇒ (480 div 0.3 times 9 + 500)/(190 + 5 times 27 div 1.6) = 2 \n\n⇒ (1600 times 9 + 500)/(190 + 5 times 16.875) = 2 \n\n⇒ (14400 + 500)/(190 + 84.375) = 2 \n\n⇒ (14900)/(274.375) = 2 \n\n⇒ 54.30 ≠ 2 (LHS ≠ RHS)\n\nHence, \"Option 2\" is the correct answer.",
